@baseUrl = https://localhost:7290
@adminUsername = AdminOne
@adminPassword = replace-with-your-bootstrap-admin-password
@requestToken = copy-the-request-token-from-the-GET-root-response

### Get registration form and antiforgery token
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### Register a standard user (first copy the form's request token above)
POST {{baseUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

__RequestVerificationToken={{requestToken}}&username=SampleUser&email=sample%40example.com&password=SamplePassword%21123

### Log in as the bootstrapped administrator
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "{{adminUsername}}",
  "password": "{{adminPassword}}"
}

### View current identity
GET {{baseUrl}}/profile

### Access administrator dashboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/dashboard

### Assign a role to an existing account
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/users/SampleUser/role
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "Admin"
}

### Log out
POST {{baseUrl}}/logout

### OpenAPI document
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi/v1.json
